[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3088\u3057\u3088\u3057\u3002\u7D20\u6750\u304C\u96C6\u307E\u3063\u3066\u304D\u305F\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "All right! We\u0027ve got quite a collection of materials!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u3061\u3089\u3082\u53CE\u7A6B\u306F\u4E0A\u3005\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u3044\u3044\u4ED5\u4E0A\u304C\u308A\u306E\u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u304C\u4F5C\u308C\u305D\u3046\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Our harvest has been excellent.\nWe should be able to make some fine chocolate with these."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ED6\u306E\u304A\u83D3\u5B50\u306B\u3082\u4F7F\u3048\u305D\u3046\u306A\u7D20\u6750\u304C\u591A\u304F\u624B\u306B\u5165\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\n\u304A\u83D3\u5B50\u4F5C\u308A\u306E\u4FEE\u696D\u3082\u3001\u3055\u3089\u306B\u9032\u307F\u305D\u3046\u3067\u3059\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We\u0027ve found many materials that could be used in other sweets too.\nLooks like our confectionery training will progress nicely."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30C8\u30EA\u30A8\u306B\u623B\u3063\u305F\u3089\u3044\u3063\u3071\u3044\u4F5C\u308B\u304B\u3089\u3001\n\u697D\u3057\u307F\u306B\u3057\u3066\u3066\u306D\u3001\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "When we get back to the atelier, I\u0027ll make lots of treats.\nLook forward to it, Plachta!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\u3044\u3002\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC\u306E\u8155\u524D\u3092\u78BA\u304B\u3081\u3066\u3042\u3052\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, I\u0027ll be sure to evaluate your skills properly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3075\u3063\u3001\u304A\u624B\u67D4\u3089\u304B\u306B\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, go easy on me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3048\u3002\u3068\u3053\u308D\u3067\u2026\u2026\n\u306A\u3093\u3060\u304B\u3054\u6A5F\u5ACC\u3067\u3059\u306D\u3001\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course. By the way...\nYou seem to be in quite good spirits, Sophie."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3001\u305D\u3046\u304B\u306A\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh? Do I?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5148\u307B\u3069\u307E\u3067\u3001\u79C1\u3068\u540C\u3058\u3088\u3046\u306B\u60A9\u3093\u3067\u3044\u305F\u306E\u306B\n\u63A1\u53D6\u3092\u59CB\u3081\u3066\u304B\u3089\u306F\u3001\u7B11\u9854\u304C\u5897\u3048\u3066\u304D\u305F\u3088\u3046\u306B\u601D\u3044\u307E\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You were worrying just like I was earlier, but\never since we started gathering materials, you\u0027ve been smiling more."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8CEA\u306E\u826F\u3044\u7D20\u6750\u3092\u898B\u3064\u3051\u3089\u308C\u305F\u304B\u3089\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is it because we found such high-quality materials?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3075\u3001\u305D\u308C\u3082\u3042\u308B\u3068\u601D\u3046\u3051\u3069\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, well that\u0027s part of it\u2014"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF\u306B\u3069\u3093\u306A\u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u3092\n\u3042\u3052\u3088\u3046\u304B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u8003\u3048\u3066\u308B\u3046\u3061\u306B\u306D\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "While I was thinking about what kind of chocolate\nI should make for you..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u81EA\u7136\u3068\u697D\u3057\u3044\u6C17\u6301\u3061\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u304D\u305F\u3093\u3060\u3088\u306D\u3002\n\u9854\u304C\u3086\u308B\u3093\u3067\u305F\u306E\u306F\u3001\u305D\u306E\u305B\u3044\u304B\u3082",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I just naturally started feeling happy.\nThat\u0027s probably why I\u0027ve been grinning."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u308B\u307B\u3069\u3002\u3067\u306F\u60A9\u307F\u3082\u89E3\u6C7A\u3057\u305F\u306E\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see. Then have you resolved your concerns?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u304C\u305C\u3093\u305C\u3093\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3088\u306D\u30FC\u3002\n\u307E\u3060\u8003\u3048\u4E2D\u3063\u3066\u3068\u3053\u308D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Not at all, actually.\nI\u0027m still thinking things through."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3067\u3057\u305F\u304B\u3002\u4E0D\u601D\u8B70\u3067\u3059\u306D\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is that so? How curious..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u3082\u2026\u2026\u30ED\u30DE\u30F3\u306B\u8A00\u308F\u308C\u305F\u8A00\u8449\u3092\n\u601D\u3044\u8FD4\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3057\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027ve been... thinking about\nwhat Roman said as well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3068\u3082\u3046\u5C11\u3057\u3067\u3001\n\u4F55\u304B\u304C\u898B\u3048\u3066\u304D\u305D\u3046\u306A\u6C17\u304C\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3059\u304C",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I feel like I\u0027m just about to\ngrasp something important..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u306A\u306E\uFF1F\u3000\u3044\u3044\u306D\uFF01\n\u3088\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3089\u8A73\u3057\u304F\u805E\u304B\u305B\u3066\u2015\u2015",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really? That\u0027s great!\nIf you\u0027d like, tell me more about\u2014"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3063\uFF01\u3000\u4ECA\u306E\u97F3\u306F\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah! That sound...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF\u3001\u3084\u3063\u3064\u3051\u3088\u3046\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta, let\u0027s take it down!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
